  "analysis_md": "对 $f(x,x^2)=x^4+2x^3+x$ 两边关于 $x$ 求导得\n\\[\nf_x(x,x^2)+2xf_y(x,x^2)=4x^3+6x^2+1,\n\\]\n则\n\\[\nf_y(x,x^2)=\\frac{4x^3+6x^2+1-f_x(x,x^2)}{2x}=2x^2+2x+1.\n\\]",
  "search_text": "若 $f(x,x^2)=x^4+2x^3+x$，$f_x(x,x^2)=2x^2-2x+1$，则 $f_y'(x,x^2)=(\\quad)$。 $2x^3+2x^2+1$ $2x^2+2x+1$ $x^3+2x^2+1$ $1-x+2x^2$ 对 $f(x,x^2)=x^4+2x^3+x$ 两边关于 $x$ 求导得\n\\[\nf_x(x,x^2)+2xf_y(x,x^2)=4x^3+6x^2+1,\n\\]\n则\n\\[\nf_y(x,x^2)=\\frac{4x^3+6x^2+1-f_x(x,x^2)}{2x}=2x^2+2x+1.\n\\]",
